{"id":"n69153-1-8","stage":3,"title":"외치다 · 高喊","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69153-1-8-1","ko":"엄마! 나 배고파요!","zh":"妈妈！我饿了！","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"엄마!","meaning":"妈妈","explanation":"엄마：妈妈","readings":[{"term":"엄마","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67098","senseId":"2","lemma":"엄마","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"배고파요!","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"9498f9014908e289","term":"엄마","zh":"妈妈","audio":"/audio/9498f9014908e2891f1f.mp3","entryId":"67098","definition":"主要加在子女名字后面，在与子女有关的事情上用于指称或称呼有子女的女性。","pronunciation":["엄마"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"8186b5026911737a","term":"배고프다","zh":"肚子饿","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3","entryId":"29316","definition":"感到肚子空了，想吃东西。","pronunciation":["배고프다"]}],"audio":"/audio/94c4914a6e507f5b8322.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69153-1-8-2","ko":"배고프다고 외친다고 밥이 빨리 되겠니?","zh":"光喊饿，饭就能快点做好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"배고프다고","meaning":"肚子饿","explanation":"배고프다：肚子饿；다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"배고프다","audio":"/audio/8186b5026911737aa1b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29316","senseId":"1","lemma":"배고프다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외친다고","meaning":"高喊，大喊","explanation":"외치다：高喊，大喊；ㄴ다고：转述陈述句的内容：“说、听说……”。","readings":[{"term":"외치다","audio":"/audio/36b4ef00774f83743273.mp3"}],"sourc